“See, Layla?” he cheerfully replied, saying the same thing Kyle had said in his note. “Didn’t I tell you everything would turn out all right?”
She smiled at the sight of his smile. Her heart was pounding, which she chalked up to the excitement.







Matthias returned to Arvis late one afternoon. As his car pulled up in front of the mansion, a sense of nervous anticipation spread throughout the staff members lined up to greet him.
His reception was nothing out of the ordinary. He was politely greeted by all the staff, as well as his joyful grandmother and smiling mother.
